OL,3,GNEWSAHouse explosion neighbours still
OL,4,Await for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbours living next to a home which
OL,7,Fwas destroyed in a gas explosion
OL,8,Ftwo-and-a-half years ago say they feel
OL,9,F"forgotten" as no repair work has taken
OL,10,Fplace.
OL,12,FA man was seriously injured and a dog
OL,13,Fdied in the blast at the property on
OL,14,FCoronation Terrace in Willington,
OL,15,FCounty Durham, in June 2024.
OL,17,FResident Barry Cooper said it is
OL,18,F"scandalous" how little work has taken
OL,19,Fplace to repair the damage and protect
OL,20,Fneighbouring homes.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
