OL,3,GNEWSAHouse explosion neighbours still
OL,4,Await for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDurham County Council's cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor planning, Joe Quinn, said they
OL,8,Fappreciate the incident was and still
OL,9,Fis "a very difficult situation" but any
OL,10,Ffurther work is the responsibility of
OL,11,Fthe property owner and their insurers.
